# Virtual Tour Dropdown Fix — Design Spec

**Date:** 2026-06-03  
**Page:** My Tours (`/my-tours`)  
**Approach:** A — fix conditions inline, minimal touch

---

## Problem

The Virtual Tour dropdown button on the tour list page has two bugs:

1. **Button gate too narrow.** `showVirtualTourlabel` in `List.jsx` only checks `item.has_main_overlay`. Tours that have an active gothru or Google overlay but no main overlay JSON never see the button.

2. **"Edit Virtual Tour" and "Virtual Tour Manager" always show.** These items have no condition, so they appear even when `has_main_overlay` is false (i.e., when the button appears only because an overlay is active).

---

## Requirements

Items must appear in this exact order:

| # | Menu Item | Show when |
|---|---|---|
| 1 | View Virtual Tour | `overlay_active === true` |
| 2 | View Google Virtual Tour | `goverlay_active === true` |
| 3 | Edit Virtual Tour | `has_main_overlay === true` |
| 4 | Virtual Tour Manager | `has_main_overlay === true` |
| — | **Dropdown button itself** | `has_main_overlay \|\| overlay_active \|\| goverlay_active` |

---

## Field Reference

These fields come from the `/v1/tours/list` API response and are already present on each tour item object:

| Field | Type | Meaning |
|---|---|---|
| `has_main_overlay` | boolean | Tour has a main overlay JSON (can be edited) |
| `overlay_active` | boolean | Gothru hosted overlay is published/active |
| `goverlay_active` | boolean | Google overlay is published/active |

---

## Changes

### 1. `src/pages/Tour/List/List.jsx` — line 515

```js
// Before
const showVirtualTourlabel = (item) => {
  return item.has_main_overlay;
};

// After
const showVirtualTourlabel = (item) => {
  return item.has_main_overlay || item.overlay_active || item.goverlay_active;
};
```

### 2. `src/components/organism/ListTour/VirtualTourDropdown.jsx` — lines 65–82

Wrap "Edit Virtual Tour" and "Virtual Tour Manager" items in `item.has_main_overlay` condition:

```jsx
{item.has_main_overlay && (
  <DropdownItem
    key={item.key}
    color="default"
    onPress={() => { openOverlayEditor(item.tour_key); }}
  >
    {t('t_my_tours.t_virtual_tour_dropdown.t_edit')}
  </DropdownItem>
)}
{item.has_main_overlay && (
  <DropdownItem
    key={`${item.key}-manager`}
    color="default"
    onPress={() => { navigate(`/my-tours/${item.moderation_id}/hosted`); }}
  >
    {t('t_my_tours.t_virtual_tour_dropdown.t_virtual_tour_manager')}
  </DropdownItem>
)}
```

---

## Files Not Touched

- `TourCard.jsx` — passes `showVirtualTourDropdown` prop unchanged
- `ToursTable.jsx` — passes `showVirtualTourDropdown` prop unchanged
- API call / `useLazyFetch` — no backend changes needed

---

## Acceptance Criteria

- A tour with `overlay_active: true` (and no `has_main_overlay`) shows the dropdown button with only "View Virtual Tour"
- A tour with `goverlay_active: true` (and no `has_main_overlay`) shows the dropdown button with only "View Google Virtual Tour"
- A tour with `has_main_overlay: true` (and no active overlays) shows the dropdown button with "Edit Virtual Tour" and "Virtual Tour Manager" — no view items
- A tour with all three flags true shows all 4 items
- A tour with all three flags false shows no dropdown button
- "View Virtual Tour" navigates to the gothru hosted overlay URL (`getTourLink(item, 'F1')`) in a new tab
- "View Google Virtual Tour" navigates to the Google overlay URL (`getTourLink(item, 'G1')`) in a new tab
- "Edit Virtual Tour" opens the overlay editor via `openOverlayEditor(item.tour_key)`
- "Virtual Tour Manager" navigates to `/my-tours/${item.moderation_id}/hosted`
- Menu items always render in order: View Virtual Tour → View Google Virtual Tour → Edit Virtual Tour → Virtual Tour Manager (items that don't meet their condition are simply absent, not reordered)
- Both grid view (TourCard) and list view (ToursTable) reflect the corrected button visibility

---

## Possible Dropdown States

| `has_main_overlay` | `overlay_active` | `goverlay_active` | Button shows? | Items visible |
|---|---|---|---|---|
| true | true | true | ✓ | All 4 |
| true | true | false | ✓ | View Tour, Edit, Manager |
| true | false | true | ✓ | View Google, Edit, Manager |
| true | false | false | ✓ | Edit, Manager |
| false | true | false | ✓ | View Tour only |
| false | false | true | ✓ | View Google only |
| false | false | false | ✗ | — |
